@quotation
@strong{@anchor{Exercise 0.3}Exercise 0.3:} Define a @code{shape} variant
whose @code{Circle} constructor carries a radius and whose @code{Rectangle}
constructor carries a width and a height, together with an @code{area}
function that dispatches on the constructor. Then add a @code{Triangle}
constructor carrying a base and a height, and let the compiler list every
site that breaks before you fix each one.
